Game collection (ten wallpapers under Games & sport)
----------------------------------------------------

Each of these wallpapers pairs original Metal shader work with material owned by
the game's publisher. Three different things ship per wallpaper, and they have
three different origins:

1. The game logo, in Resources/WallpaperMarks/Game*.png, is the publisher's own
   logo downloaded from Steam's CDN or from PlayStation. The downloaded PNG
   bytes are unchanged.
2. The detail-page banner, in Resources/Wallpapers/<id>/Official.png, is the
   publisher's official promotional artwork, converted from JPEG to PNG so the
   asset resolver can read it. Nothing else about it was altered.
3. The animated background, in Resources/Artwork/Game*.png, is AI-generated fan
   art made for this project and upscaled locally. It is NOT the publisher's
   artwork, and no publisher asset was used to produce it.

The scene each wallpaper renders -- Scene.metal and GameAtmosphere.metal -- is
original work by this project and is covered by the Apache licence.

Items 1 and 2 are excluded from the project's Apache license. No part of the
Apache grant applies to them, and this notice grants no rights to them. The
retrieval date and exact source URL for every file are recorded in
