Weather and location data
-------------------------

Forza Horizon 5, Red Dead Redemption 2 and Ghost of Tsushima read public
forecast data from Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com), licensed CC BY 4.0, with
city data from GeoNames. Black Myth: Wukong reads public player counts and
announcements from the Steam Web API. The default endpoints are Open-Meteo's
public non-commercial service; a commercial distribution must configure a
licensed service under https://open-meteo.com/en/terms.

Real-ESRGAN
-----------

The game backgrounds were upscaled with Real-ESRGAN ncnn
(https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN-ncnn-vulkan) as a build-time step. It is
a tool used to prepare assets, not a dependency of the app, and none of its code
ships in UnfoldMyMac.

